.TH V2_ADD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
v2_add \- Component\-wise sum a + b
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "Vec2 v2_add(Vec2 a, Vec2 b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Component\-wise sum a + b. Moving a position by a displacement: pos = v2_add(pos, v2_scale(vel, dt)).
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a + b.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR v2_sub (3),
.BR v2_scale (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
